{
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "text": "# Clinical Decision Support: Cardiac Risk Triage\n\n## Benefit\nEnhanced diagnostic accuracy, personalised treatment recommendations, improved patient flow.\n\n## Use Case\nA data platform that integrates AI models with patient records to provide real-time risk predictions, drug interactions, and treatment suggestions. \nIn this scenario cardiac risk scores are generated in real-time and used by clinicals to identify patients that can be safely fast-tracked for discharge.\n\n## Outcome\nImproved hospital flow and resource utlization, reduced misdiagnoses, early detection of diseases, and optimized treatment plans.\n\n### Average ED Discharge rates by region\n\nRegion/Country          % Discharged Without Admission\nUnited States\t        ~80% (CDC, 2021)\nUnited Kingdom (NHS)\t~75–85%\nAustralia\t            ~70–80% (AIHW data)\nCanada\t                ~75–80%\nEurope (average)\t    ~65–80%, depending on healthcare system",
      "user": "HEALTHCARE@ZETARIS.COM",
      "dateUpdated": "2025-04-06 14:30:10.693",
      "progress": 0,
